# Service Orchestration Pattern

Enforces service orchestration of all business logic. Routes are thin, services orchestrate.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Writing routes or services
- Business logic detected in routes
- Direct infrastructure calls in routes
- Need to orchestrate workflows

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Stable orchestration patterns

